<template compat="shopify">
{%- comment -%}
  Cart drawer tools row, bottom sheets and footer actions. Rendered last
  inside <cart-notification>. Its styles are the last part of
  shopify/assets/cart-drawer.css (linked by cart-drawer-presentation), so
  they still win over the older layers. The drawer's scripts (addons, polish
  and sheets, in that order) are shopify/assets/cart-drawer.js, loaded here,
  deferred: they run once the page has arrived, before DOMContentLoaded.
{%- endcomment -%}
<script src="{{ 'cart-drawer.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>
</template>
